1. Included in this repository
==============================================================================

Qwen3 chat template
  Owner:    the Qwen team, publisher of the Qwen/Qwen3 model repositories
  Source:   the chat_template field of tokenizer_config.json in
            https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-8B (revision
            b968826d9c46dd6066d109eabc6255188de91218). The same template is
            byte-identical in Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B and Qwen/Qwen3-32B-AWQ at the
            revisions pinned in versions.yaml.
  License:  Apache License 2.0 (full text below)
  Files:
    manifests/02-serving/chat-templates/upstream/qwen3-a55ee1b1.jinja
        Unmodified copy of the upstream template.
    manifests/02-serving/chat-templates/qwen3-nonthinking.jinja
        Modified. The generation-prompt tail always renders the empty
        reasoning block, so thinking stays off for every request. The
        comment header of the file describes the change.
    manifests/02-serving/chat-template-qwen3-nonthinking.yaml
        Kubernetes ConfigMap that carries the modified template unchanged.

  Each modified file carries a notice stating that it was changed
  (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)).

